WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:01.440
Chu Huan

00:01.520 --> 00:02.320
Don't worry

00:02.400 --> 00:03.680
Fight our way out

00:03.760 --> 00:06.160
I will enter the palace to see His Majesty

00:06.240 --> 00:07.640
One

00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
Protect Your Highness and break through

00:39.640 --> 00:40.760
General Zu Yue

00:40.840 --> 00:41.840
Let me explain

00:41.920 --> 00:43.320
There's a misunderstanding

00:43.440 --> 00:45.107
I act on military orders

00:45.440 --> 00:47.107
If Your Highness has grievances

00:47.200 --> 00:49.200
You can explain to His Majesty

00:50.440 --> 00:51.760
Please

